## Phase 0 — Audit Existing Project

**Purpose:** Don't touch the existing demo until Claude understands it.

Claude checks:

- Existing folder structure
- Routes
- Components
- Dependencies
- `public/` assets
- Product data
- Current styling
- Existing functionality
- Vercel/demo implementation
- What can be reused
- What needs to be refactored
- What is currently mocked

### Important rule

**No modifications whatsoever.**

Claude only gives you an audit/report.

This protects your existing client demo.

---

# Phase 1 — Design System + Homepage

This combines the visual/design work and homepage because they are tightly connected.

### Global design

Implement:

- AT-ONE color system
- Typography
- Spacing
- Buttons
- Cards
- Forms
- Badges
- Shadows
- Responsive containers
- Animations
- Made in India identity

Design direction:

> Premium, clean, modern Indian manufacturing brand.

And explicitly:

> **No glassmorphism.**  
> No excessive gradients.  
> No excessive rounded cards.  
> No heavy colors.  
> No generic AI-template appearance.

### Global components

Build/refine:

- Top bar
- Navbar
- Mobile menu
- Footer
- Made in India badge

### Homepage

Then transform the existing homepage:

- Hero
- Product showcase
- Trust section
- Categories
- Featured products
- Bulk-order CTA
- Why AT-ONE
- Business types
- Bulk-order process
- Manufacturing/About section
- Final CTA

At the end of Phase 1, you should have a **professional-looking website shell + polished homepage**.

